  "body_html": "<p>统帅，你的队伍默认有六人上下。将他们视作一名带 <em>群体</em> 标签的追随者。此处的起始数值在游戏中皆可变动。</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">队伍</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"HP上限\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">HP上限</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"护甲\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">护甲</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"伤害\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"掷伤害\">伤害</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">HP起始为每人6；护甲为0；伤害为d6。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">标签</h3>\n<p>你的队伍起始拥有 <em>群体</em> ——由你的背景所授——外加2项由你选择。</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>弓手</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>身手矫健</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>勇敢</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>狡黠</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>忠心耿耿</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"起始已勾选\"> <span><em>群体</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>吃苦耐劳</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>威风慑人</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>眼观六路</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>有耐性</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>受人敬重</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>隐秘</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>战士</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填写\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填写\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填写\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>卓异</em> （需要「至死是英雄」）</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">本能</h3>\n<p>选1。</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>拌嘴内讧、记仇怀恨</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>固守传统与迷信</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>放纵低劣的本性</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>对人颐指气使</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>冒不必要的险</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>做事过了头</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填写\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">代价</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>选1。</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">忠诚</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"忠诚 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"忠诚 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"忠诚 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"忠诚 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"忠诚 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"忠诚 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>众人一同寻欢作乐</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>当众的认可、尊重与荣誉</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>你为帮他们亲身涉险</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>战胜劲敌</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>为自己或石顶挣得财富</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填写\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">行囊</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ 以内为轻装；4-6 ◇ 为常装；7-9 ◇ 为重装。</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>手斧</strong>，铁制（<em>近身</em>, <em>投掷</em>、x 穿刺）</li><li>◇ <strong>长矛</strong>，铁制（<em>近战</em>, <em>投掷</em>、x 穿刺）</li><li>◇ <strong>弓与铁箭</strong> (<em>近距</em>、x 穿刺、○ 箭矢将尽、○ 箭矢耗光）</li><li>◇◇ <strong>盾牌</strong> （+1 护甲；守护掷出7+时 +1 戒备）</li><li>◇◇ <strong>厚兽皮</strong> （1 护甲、 <em>保暖</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>斗篷</strong> (<em>保暖</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>补给品</strong> （每名队员 4+繁荣度 份）</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">补给品</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"第1份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"第1份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"第2份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"第2份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"第3份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"第3份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"第4份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"第4份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"第5份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"第5份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"第6份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"第6份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"第7份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"第7份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"第8份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"第8份\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"第1份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"第1份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"第2份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"第2份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"第3份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"第3份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"第4份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"第4份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"第5份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"第5份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"第6份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"第6份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"第7份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"第7份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"第8份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"第8份\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"第1份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"第1份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"第2份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"第2份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"第3份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"第3份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"第4份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"第4份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"第5份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"第5份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"第6份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"第6份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"第7份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"第7份\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"第8份\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"第8份\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">其他装备</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">个别成员</h3>\n<p>当有人崭露头角时，给他起个名字，配一个标签和一项或多项特质。</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">姓名</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"姓名\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">标签</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"标签\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特质</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特质\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">姓名</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"姓名\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">标签</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"标签\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特质</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特质\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">姓名</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"姓名\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">标签</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"标签\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特质</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特质\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">姓名</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"姓名\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">标签</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"标签\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特质</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特质\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">姓名</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"姓名\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">标签</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"标签\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特质</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特质\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">姓名</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"姓名\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">标签</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"标签\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特质</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特质\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>名字：</strong> 阿莱德、库尔威奇、艾拉、格拉特、格劳、哈里、洛里、梅尔文、内丝塔</p>\n<p><strong>标签：</strong> <em>爱惜牲口、块头大、横行霸道、愤世嫉俗、酒鬼、干劲十足、好赌、贪财、脾气坏、耳根子软、万人迷、老实、心善、下流、个头小、天真、年迈、人缘好、心高气傲、新手、莽撞、不知羞、目光锐利、火气大</em></p>\n<p><strong>特质：</strong> ___的孩子/手足/爹娘/表亲/___、秃头、暗恋___、记恨___、憎恶___、崇拜___、爱说笑、邋遢、缺了眼睛/手指/手/___、想念自家孩子、做噩梦、新婚不久、虔诚、带疤、精瘦、嘴毒、爱唱歌、打鼾、爱吹牛、太严肃、家里不顺、爱吹口哨、爱削木头</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">备注</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"备注\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">号令追随者</h3>\n<p>当你 <strong><em>指使他们做出某个行动、而他们照做</em></strong>时，若其任一标签适用，掷 +1 而非 +属性（若他们还是 <em>卓异</em>的，则掷 +2）。若无标签适用，掷 +0。若其任一标签会碍事，掷骰带劣势。</p>\n<p>当他们 <strong><em>没有得到指令</em></strong> 或 <strong><em>自作主张行事</em></strong>时，由GM决定他们做什么、结果如何。</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">加深羁绊</h3>\n<p>当你 <strong><em>付出他们的代价</em></strong> 且近来未曾付出过时，他们持有 +1 忠诚（上限3）。</p>\n<p>按1比1花费其忠诚，可让他们：</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>克服恐惧，照你说的做</li><li>克制住不按其本能/标签/特质行事</li><li>去做他们不愿做的事（只要不是伤天害理或自寻死路）</li></ul>"
}
